    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend a chapter of the laws of 2020 amending the local finance law\nrelating to bond anticipation notes issued in calendar years 2015 through\n2021, as proposed in legislative bills numbers S. 8417 and A. 10492, in\nrelation to expenditures and temporary transfer of reserve funds for expenses\nrelated to state disaster emergency declared pursuant to executive order 202\nof 2020 and authorizing the extension of repayment of inter-fund advances made\nfor expenses related to state disaster emergency declared pursuant to\nexecutive order 202 of 2020 (Part A); to amend the public service law, in\nrelation to issuing a moratorium on utility termination of services during\nperiods of pandemics and/or state of emergencies; and to amend a chapter of\nthe laws of 2020 amending the public service law, relating to issuing a\nmoratorium on utility termination of services during periods of pandemics\nand/or state of emergencies, as proposed in legislative bills numbers S.8113-A\nand A.10521, in relation to the effectiveness thereof (Part B); to amend the\nbanking law, in relation to the forbearance of residential mortgage payments\n(Part C); and to amend the criminal procedure law, in relation to hearings\nconducted on a felony complaint during a state disaster emergency (Part D)",
    "basePrintNo": "S8428",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S8428-2019",
    "coSponsors": {
